{"id":"wb-7-1560","name":"慈云寺石刻","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"慈云寺 (巩义)","text":"慈云寺位于河南省巩义市东南方的青龙山，始建于东汉永平七年（64年）。据登封法王寺《重修大法王寺碑记》云，“嵩阴慈云、洛阳白马、嵩阳法王，乃中国作寺之始”。故慈云寺也被认为是佛教传入中国后最早的寺院之一。\n慈云寺中的碑刻以“慈云寺石刻”之名于2000年9月被列入河南省文物保护单位，2013年3月被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%85%88%E4%BA%91%E5%AF%BA_(%E5%B7%A9%E4%B9%89)","revisionId":86856375,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856375","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4c3995afa05a00ec05f38531.jpg","title":"20160925_Ciyun_Temple_in_Gongyi.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20160925_Ciyun_Temple_in_Gongyi.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/20160925_Ciyun_Temple_in_Gongyi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Ciyun Temple","width":320,"height":213}}